<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">kinetic-shove</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Kinetic Shove</ansi> spell slams a target with a burst of telekinetic
force, knocking them to the ground. A prone enemy is far easier to
strike and defends less effectively — making this spell a powerful
combat opener or follow-up.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast kinetic-shove [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Harm Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Elemental
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 3
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 30
  <ansi fg="yellow">Defense:     </ansi> Physical — quick reflexes can dodge it; armor only
                 softens what lands
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Knockdown — sends the target to the ground

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help spells</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help cast</ansi>
